MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The HD streaming stick feels useful because it would add streaming to my Samsung TV alongside my DVD player, and HD fits my 720p screen.",
    "The microSD card connects with my repeated memory-card purchases and could expand my Fire 7 storage, provided it is compatible."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo devices and smart plug assume I want voice control or home automation, while my purchases reflect practical storage, charging, mounting and connection needs.",
    "A larger Fire tablet does not address a stated need to replace my Fire 7, and six one-foot Ethernet cables do not match any connection need I currently have."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning a Fire tablet seems to have been taken as interest in many other Amazon devices, although sharing a brand does not make them useful to me.",
    "My cable and power-strip purchases seem to have been treated as broad interest in connectivity and smart outlets, without enough attention to their specific purpose."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Compatibility and specifications matter: my TV is 720p, a memory card must work with my Fire 7, and a cable needs the right connections and length.",
    "I often buy accessories that support devices I already own. That makes a useful storage expansion more compelling than replacing my tablet or adding a dedicated screen."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in practical electronics but stretched my Fire ownership into an unsupported interest in a broader Alexa setup."
}
